OL,3,GNEWSABusinesses unsure when shopping
OL,4,Acentre will reopen
OL,5,
OL,6,FBusinesses remain unsure about when a
OL,7,Fshopping centre could reopen, a week
OL,8,Fafter it was forced to shut.
OL,10,FThe Buttermarket in Ipswich was closed
OL,11,Fon 21 September after the "failure" of
OL,12,Fa tempered glass panel in the north
OL,13,Fmall.
OL,15,FAlan Rayner, whose clothes shop is one
OL,16,Fof the few units allowed to stay open,
OL,17,Fsaid the wider site could be shut for
OL,18,Fanother week.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
